        "y0": 0.4817340557391827,
        "x1": 0.8857760882485506,
        "y1": 0.4983253076245522
      },
      "text": "It may be seen that only when the parameters of the electrical and magnetic",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.5016435764134379,
        "x1": 0.8858084700226244,
        "y1": 0.5182348282988075
      },
      "text": "components inside the quanton are equal, in particular for the Coulomb",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.5215530970876933,
        "x1": 0.8858556963199944,
        "y1": 0.5381443489730628
      },
      "text": "forces (2.10), the relationship (2.11) between the values of the elementary",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.5414626177619486,
        "x1": 0.8855745479531957,
        "y1": 0.5580538696473181
      },
      "text": "magnetic and electrical charges corresponds to the previously determined",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.5613721384362038,
        "x1": 0.885584421287295,
        "y1": 0.5779633903215733
      },
      "text": "relationship (2.6). Shorter distances between the charges inside the quanton",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.581281659110459,
        "x1": 0.8857187814841982,
        "y1": 0.5978729109958286
      },
      "text": "determine colossal attraction forces (2.10) which characterise the quantised",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.6011911567699495,
        "x1": 0.45697263139405403,
        "y1": 0.6177824086553191
      },
      "text": "space-time by colossal elasticity.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14742218638976776,
        "y0": 0.6211006544294401,
        "x1": 0.8858756328600025,
        "y1": 0.6376919063148097
      },
      "text": "Thus, the electromagnetic symmetry of the quanton determines the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.6410101520889305,
        "x1": 0.8865426180049845,
        "y1": 0.6576014039743001
      },
      "text": "relationships (2.6) and (2.1) and also the correspondence of these",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.660919649748421,
        "x1": 0.8856391734127546,
        "y1": 0.6775109016337906
      },
      "text": "relationships to the Maxwell equations (2.3) and the Coulomb law (2.10).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.6808291474079116,
        "x1": 0.88573873528528,
        "y1": 0.697420399293281
      },
      "text": "The Dirac relationship (2.2) does not correspond to (2.3) and (2.10), is not",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.700738645067402,
        "x1": 0.8857835450323459,
        "y1": 0.7173298969527715
      },
      "text": "written in the SI system and uses the procedure based on the unambiguous",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.7206481427268925,
        "x1": 0.8858133721675269,
        "y1": 0.737239394612262
      },
      "text": "yield of the phase of the wave function of the electron whose parameters",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.7405576403863829,
        "x1": 0.6096113386197327,
        "y1": 0.7571488922717524
      },
      "text": "include not only the elementary electrical charge",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6095018343688137,
        "y0": 0.7405576403863829,
        "x1": 0.6205516142003676,
        "y1": 0.7571488922717524
      },
      "text": "e",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6209049828991091,
        "y0": 0.7405576403863829,
        "x1": 0.8854027657487273,
        "y1": 0.7571488922717524
      },
      "text": "but also other parameters,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.7604671380458734,
        "x1": 0.8855869759261877,
        "y1": 0.7770583899312429
      },
      "text": "which determine the wave properties of the electron in the quantised space-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.7803766357053639,
        "x1": 0.8856989657717054,
        "y1": 0.7969678875907334
      },
      "text": "time. It should be accepted that as regards the procedure, Dirac made an",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.8002861333648543,
        "x1": 0.8856715551868284,
        "y1": 0.8168773852502239
      },
      "text": "error but this does not reduce role in the investigations of the magnetic",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.8201956310243448,
        "x1": 0.8860996298121111,
        "y1": 0.8367868829097144
      },
      "text": "monopole. In the pure form, the monopole elementary electrical and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.8401051286838352,
        "x1": 0.88573873528528,
        "y1": 0.8566963805692048
      },
      "text": "magnetic charges are included only in the structure of the quanton, and the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.8600146263433258,
        "x1": 0.885584421287295,
        "y1": 0.8766058782286953
      },
      "text": "analysis of the properties of the quanton yielded the true relationships (2.6)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11538530582755939,
        "y0": 0.8799241240028163,
        "x1": 0.22777942294988157,
        "y1": 0.8965153758881859
      },
      "text": "and (2.11).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14742218638976776,
        "y0": 0.8998336274159979,
        "x1": 0.8857486604026,
        "y1": 0.9164248793013675
      },
      "text": "In fact, the forces (2.10) inside the quanton are colossal in magnitude",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
  ],
